Z||000000||deceler8||10-30-2001||09:59 PM||||I'd have to recommend Grand Am buckets.<P>Cheap, plentiful, and a pattern similar to that of the Fiero fabric.<P>You do have to use the Fiero tracks, but it's simple to switch them.<P>Mine came out of a '91, but I'd bet any of them would work. And $50 for a pair at my local wrecker.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/deceler8_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
