Z||000004||deceler8||10-31-2001||09:16 AM||||The tracks on the Grand Am seats bolt on just like the Fiero seats. All the holes in the Grand Am seat match the holes in the Fiero seats, so the Fiero tracks just bolt on in place of the Grand Am tracks.<P>I'd post a pic, but these look just like the gray seats they replace.<P>And these came out of a four-door Grand Am.<P>They seem softer than the Fiero seats, and recline and fit just like the originals.||||reg||1
